{"step_index":23,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-21T06:22:35Z","model":"gemini-3.8-flash-tiered","input_tokens":8512,"cache_read_tokens":74574,"output_tokens":776,"thinking":"Initial diagnosis indicates Rice Blast, a severe fungal disease requiring immediate intervention. The recommended organic treatment involves a fermented cow urine extract and turmeric powder, or Pseudomonas fluorescens. For chemical treatment, Tricyclazole or Isoprothiolane are suggested.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"webview_browser","args":{"intention":"Scroll to Mandi & Schemes, test search filter on Mandi prices table, open PM-KISAN modal, and close it","observation":"Crop Doctor diagnosis verified successfully. Moving to Mandi & Schemes section.","script":"// Scroll to Mandi & Schemes\nawait page.locator('#mandi').scrollIntoViewIfNeeded();\n\n// Find search filter input\nconst searchInput = page.getByPlaceholder(/Filter by crop, state, or market mandi/i);\nawait searchInput.fill('Tomato');\n\n// Get filtered row count / text\nconst tomatoRows = await page.locator('#mandi table tbody tr').allInnerTexts();\n\n// Search for another commodity: Mustard\nawait searchInput.fill('Mustard');\nconst mustardRows = await page.locator('#mandi table tbody tr').allInnerTexts();\n\n// Clear search\nawait searchInput.clear();\nconst allRowsCount = await page.locator('#mandi table tbody tr').count();\n\n// Scroll to schemes section and click \"View Application Steps\" on PM-KISAN\nconst pmKisanBtn = page.getByRole('button', { name: /View Application Steps/i }).first();\nawait pmKisanBtn.scrollIntoViewIfNeeded();\nawait pmKisanBtn.click();\n\n// Wait for scheme modal\nconst modal = page.locator('.fixed.inset-0').filter({ hasText: /Application Steps|PM-KISAN/i });\nawait modal.first().waitFor({ state: 'visible', timeout: 5000 });\nconst modalText = await modal.first().innerText();\n\n// Close modal\nconst closeBtn = modal.locator('button').filter({ hasText: /Close/i }).first();\nawait closeBtn.click();\n\nreturn {\n  searchTomato: tomatoRows,\n  searchMustard: mustardRows,\n  totalTableRows: allRowsCount,\n  pmKisanModalSnippet: modalText.slice(0, 800)\n};"}}]}
