ts reserved. · Data sources: ICAR, DAC&FW, Agmarknet, Open Agricultural Data. Built for farmer prosperity.\"\n- button \"Ask AI Agronomist\" [ref=e91] [cursor=pointer] [occluded]: Ask Krishi AI\n- generic:\n  - heading \"Ask Krishi AI Agronomist\" [level=3]\n  - text: Instant 24x7 intelligent agricultural consulting in your language.\n  - button \"Close Assistant\" [ref=e127] [cursor=pointer]\n  - text: \"Common Farmer Queries:\"\n  - button \"Best fertilizer for paddy in clay soil?\" [ref=e128] [cursor=pointer]\n  - button \"How to protect crops from heavy monsoon rain?\" [ref=e129] [cursor=pointer]\n  - button \"Organic pest control for tomato leaf curl\" [ref=e130] [cursor=pointer]\n  - button \"What crop to plant after wheat harvest?\" [ref=e131] [cursor=pointer]\n  - generic [ref=e132]: Namaste! I am your AgriSense AI Agronomist. How can I assist with your crops, soil, pest remedies, or Mandi rates today? · Just now · Best fertilizer for paddy in clay soil? · 11:54 AM · 🌾 **Paddy in Clay / Heavy Soils:** • **Basal Dose:** Apply 50% Nitrogen (Urea), full dose of Single Super Phosphate (SSP 60kg/ha), 75% MOP, and 25 kg Zinc Sulfate/ha during final puddling. • **Top Dressing:** 25% Nitrogen at active tillering (21-25 days) + 25% Nitrogen at panicle initiation. • **Water Management:** Maintain 3-5 cm standing water during vegetative tillering. Drain 10 days before harvest. · 11:54 AM · Listening to your voice...\n  - form:\n    - textbox \"Ask about fertilizers, pest remedies, crop rotation, soil health...\" [ref=e133]\n    - button \"Voice Input (Speech-to-Text)\" [active] [ref=e134] [cursor=pointer]\n    - button \"Send Message\" [ref=e135] [cursor=pointer]\n  - text: AI Agronomist provides guidance based on ICAR and agricultural research datasets. For severe localized outbreaks, consult your local Krishi Vigyan Kendra (KVK).\n</untrusted_page_content>","media":[{"mime_type":"image/png","uri":"file:///C:/Users/abasu/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8280cdb4-257b-4bb7-95